(1)   20/  C1D09A :                     ; Soft DIPs format:
(1)   21/  C1D09A :                     ; There can be max 4 special settings + 10 normal settings = 14 lines
(1)   22/  C1D09A :                     ; These are shown in the MVS BIOS as 2 pages, first has max 8 lines, second has max 6
(1)   23/  C1D09A :                     ; Note: BIOS_GAME_DIP is already init by the original BIOS (see ReadCDDAFlagSDIPs).
(1)   24/  C1D09A :                     
(1)   25/  C1D09A :                     ; Ask to save contents of BIOS_GAME_DIP to the SD card
(1)   26/  C1D09A :                     StoreSDIPs:
